    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8096" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνειλ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>roll up</i> or <i>crowd together,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολεμίους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					2.11
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, <i>crowd</i> or <i>throng together,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνειληθέντες εῐς τι χωρίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.81
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ μέλιτται . . αὐτοῦ ἀνειλοῦνται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					627b12
				</span></i>
			; of wind <i>pent in the bowels,</i>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνεῦμα - <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ούμενον</span></span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				2p.46U.
			</span></i>; of sound, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Aud.</u>
				804a20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνειλεῖται ἡ γλῶσσα</span>”
				<i>is kept within bounds,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.503c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>unroll,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				109d
			</span></i>.</div>
